<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-WOMEN'S STYRIA OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WOMEN'S STYRIA OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MARIA LANKOWITZ, Austria 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $107,500 Styria Open women's tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>6-Henriete Nagyova (Slovakia) beat Petra Begerow (Germany) 3-6 6-4 3-2, Begerow retired injured.</p>
<p>Ines Gorrochategui (Argentina) beat Katarina Studenikova (Slovakia) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>5-Barbara Schett (Austria) beat Cristina Torrens Valero (Spain), Torrens Valero retired ill without playing.  </p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>1-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Nina Louarsabishvili (Georgia)</p>
<p>6-2 3-6 6-1</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>Meike Babel (Germany) beat Joannette Kruger (South Africa) 6-4</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Gala Leon Garcia (Spain) beat 7-Denisa Chladkova (Czech</p>
<p>Republic)</p>
<p>6-0 6-3</p>
</text>
